From eb451dc17f594762d1ed152db078ab6266582f1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 07:42:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add homepage "Our Expertise" grid section before Why V-Chip

New dark 3x2 card grid (inspired by a reference site, copy rewritten
in V-Chip's own voice rather than copied) covering six of V-Chip's
service pages: Architecture Planning, IP Selection & Integration,
Design Verification, Custom Analog Design, Physical Design, and
full-turnkey Chip Design. Each card links through to its matching
service page. Placed between the "Capabilities under one roof" panel
and the "Why V-Chip?" section per the v2.0 layout.

Icons are plain (no background badge), bold red line icons sized up
for presence; card headings are bold, body copy stays regular weight.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SjcntVjf5Nr2bdomgFdfPu
---
 index.html | 101 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 styles.css |  86 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 187 insertions(+)

